IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `dpa-welfare-homes`

-- Destitute Persons Act 1989, ss 2, 3, 4, 6, 7(2), 10 to 14, 16 to 20 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_destitute-persons-act-1989.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

