§ `ss 4, 12(3), 16 to 19`

#ASSERT `the maximum fine in dollars` `carer failing to report` EQUALS 500
#ASSERT `the maximum fine in dollars` `leaving the home` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in months` `carer failing to report` EQUALS 2
